Chorwadi Parshwanath. This idol is also identified as Shri Chintamani Parshwanath. As the idol has a smiling countenance, this form of Parshwanath is also known as \\\"Hasmukh Parshwanath\\\" (\\\"the smiling one\\\"). This temple is managed by the Shri Mangroli Jain Sangh.. Directions: This temple is 7 kilometers from Chorwad railway station. Girnar Tirth, Barej Tirth, and Mangrol Tirth are all nearby. Mangrol Tirth (Shri Navpallav Parshwanath) is 18 km from here, and Prabhas Patan Tirth is 27 km away. There is an upashraya here.. Scripture References: Chorwadi Parshwanath is mentioned in \\\"Tirthmala,\\\" \\\"Shashwat Tirthmala,\\\" \\\"365 Shri Parshva Jin Nammala,\\\" \\\"Shri Bhagwan Parshwanath Stavan,\\\" \\\"Shri Parshwanath Nathwala,\\\" \\\"Shri 108 Parshwanath Chhand,\\\" \\\"135 Nam Garbhit Shri Parshwanath Stavan,\\\" and others. An image of Chorwadi Parshwanath is also present at Jiravala Tirth and at the Kalikund Parshwanath Temple in Santacruz, Mumbai.. Hymn of Praise: He who dispels delusion (moha) yet wears a smile upon his face; he who is seated in Chorwad yet drives away the thief of attachment; O smiling one of Chorwad, all obey your command. \\\"With loving devotion I bow to Shri Chorwadi Parshwa.\\\" O smiling one, you have come to your court; we have been robbed by the thief of karma - what more is there to say? O son of Vama, beloved of Chorwad, save me from the thief of delusion; at the feet of \\\"Chorwadi\\\" Parshwa, I offer my body, mind, and wealth forever.. Chanting Mantra: Om Hrim Arham Shri Chorwadi Parshwanathaya Namah.. Trust: Shri Chorwadi Parshwanath Shwetambar Jain Temple, Athamno Darvajo, Post: Chorwad, Taluka: Veraval, District: Junagadh, Saurashtra, State: Gujarat - 362250, India. Phone: 02870-288774, Mobile: 9723566614 (priest).\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\